 "content": "<div id=\"content\"><div id=\"changesOverTime\"><h2>Changes over time for:  Section 57</h2><div class=\"timelineHelp\"><a href=\"#timelineHelp\" class=\"helpItem helpItemToMidLeft\"><img src=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/images/chrome/helpIcon.gif\" alt=\" Help about opening options\"></a></div><div id=\"timeline\"><div id=\"timelineData\"><h3>Alternative versions:</h3><ul><li class=\"currentVersion\"><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukpga/2015/2/section/57/2015-04-13\"><span class=\"pointer\"></span><span>13/04/2015<em class=\"accessibleText\">- Amendment</em></span></a><span class=\"end\"></span></li></ul></div></div></div><div id=\"statusWarning\" class=\"uptoDate\"><div class=\"title\"><h2>Changes to legislation:</h2><p class=\"intro\">There are currently no known outstanding effects for the Criminal Justice and Courts Act 2015, Section 57.<a href=\"#Scenario1Help\" class=\"helpItem helpItemToBot\"><img src=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/images/chrome/helpIcon.gif\" alt=\" Help about Changes to Legislation\"></a></p><div class=\"help\" id=\"Scenario1Help\"><span class=\"icon\"></span><div class=\"content\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"close\"><img alt=\"Close\" src=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/images/chrome/closeIcon.gif\"></a><h3>Changes to Legislation</h3><p>Revised legislation carried on this site may not be fully up to date. At the current time any known changes or effects made by subsequent legislation have been applied to the text of the legislation you are viewing by the editorial team. Please see ‘Frequently Asked Questions’ for details regarding the timescales for which new effects are identified and recorded on this site.</p></div></div></div></div><div id=\"viewLegContents\"><div class=\"LegSnippet\" id=\"viewLegSnippet\"><a class=\"LegAnchorID\" id=\"section-57\"></a><h4>57Personal injury claims: cases of fundamental dishonestyE+W</h4><div class=\"eniw\"><span class=\"enNote\">This section has no associated Explanatory Notes</span></div><p class=\"LegClearFix LegP2Container\"><span class=\"LegDS LegLHS LegP2No\" id=\"section-57-1\">(1)</span><span class=\"LegDS LegRHS LegP2Text\">This section applies where, in proceedings on a claim for damages in respect of personal injury (“the primary claim”)—</span>\r</p><p class=\"LegClearFix LegP3Container\"><span class=\"LegDS LegLHS LegP3No\" id=\"section-57-1-a\">(a)</span><span class=\"LegDS LegRHS LegP3Text\">the court finds that the claimant is entitled to damages in respect of the claim, but</span>\r</p><p class=\"LegClearFix LegP3Container\"><span class=\"LegDS LegLHS LegP3No\" id=\"section-57-1-b\">(b)</span><span class=\"LegDS LegRHS LegP3Text\">on an application by the defendant for the dismissal of the claim under this section, the court is satisfied on the balance of probabilities that the claimant has been fundamentally dishonest in relation to the primary claim or a related claim.</span>\r</p><p class=\"LegClearFix LegP2Container\"><span class=\"LegDS LegLHS LegP2No\" id=\"section-57-2\">(2)</span><span class=\"LegDS LegRHS LegP2Text\">The court must dismiss the primary claim, unless it is satisfied that the claimant would suffer substantial injustice if the claim were dismissed.</span>\r</p><p class=\"LegClearFix LegP2Container\"><span class=\"LegDS LegLHS LegP2No\" id=\"section-57-3\">(3)</span><span class=\"LegDS LegRHS LegP2Text\">The duty under subsection (2) includes the dismissal of any element of the primary claim in respect of which the claimant has not been dishonest.</span>\r</p><p class=\"LegClearFix LegP2Container\"><span class=\"LegDS LegLHS LegP2No\" id=\"section-57-4\">(4)</span><span class=\"LegDS LegRHS LegP2Text\">The court's order dismissing the claim must record the amount of damages that the court would have awarded to the claimant in respect of the primary claim but for the dismissal of the claim.</span>\r</p><p class=\"LegClearFix LegP2Container\"><span class=\"LegDS LegLHS LegP2No\" id=\"section-57-5\">(5)</span><span class=\"LegDS LegRHS LegP2Text\">When assessing costs in the proceedings, a court which dismisses a claim under this section must deduct the amount recorded in accordance with subsection (4) from the amount which it would otherwise order the claimant to pay in respect of costs incurred by the defendant.</span>\r</p><p class=\"LegClearFix LegP2Container\"><span class=\"LegDS LegLHS LegP2No\" id=\"section-57-6\">(6)</span><span class=\"LegDS LegRHS LegP2Text\">If a claim is dismissed under this section, subsection (7) applies to—</span>\r</p><p class=\"LegClearFix LegP3Container\"><span class=\"LegDS LegLHS LegP3No\" id=\"section-57-6-a\">(a)</span><span class=\"LegDS LegRHS LegP3Text\">any subsequent criminal proceedings against the claimant in respect of the fundamental dishonesty mentioned in subsection (1)(b), and</span>\r</p><p class=\"LegClearFix LegP3Container\"><span class=\"LegDS LegLHS LegP3No\" id=\"section-57-6-b\">(b)</span><span class=\"LegDS LegRHS LegP3Text\">any subsequent proceedings for contempt of court against the claimant in respect of that dishonesty.</span>\r</p><p class=\"LegClearFix LegP2Container\"><span class=\"LegDS LegLHS LegP2No\" id=\"section-57-7\">(7)</span><span class=\"LegDS LegRHS LegP2Text\">If the court in those proceedings finds the claimant guilty of an offence or of contempt of court, it must have regard to the dismissal of the primary claim under this section when sentencing the claimant or otherwise disposing of the proceedings.</span>\r</p><p class=\"LegClearFix LegP2Container\"><span class=\"LegDS LegLHS LegP2No\" id=\"section-57-8\">(8)</span><span class=\"LegDS LegRHS LegP2Text\">In this section—</span>\r</p><ul class=\"LegTabbedDef LegUnorderedList\"><li><p class=\"LegListTextStandard LegLevel3\">“<span class=\"LegTerm\" id=\"term-claim\">claim</span>” includes a counter-claim and, accordingly, “<span class=\"LegTerm\" id=\"term-claimant\">claimant</span>” includes a counter-claimant and “<span class=\"LegTerm\" id=\"term-defendant\">defendant</span>” includes a defendant to a counter-claim;\r</p></li><li><p class=\"LegListTextStandard LegLevel3\">“<span class=\"LegTerm\" id=\"term-personal-injury\">personal injury</span>” includes any disease and any other impairment of a person's physical or mental condition;\r</p></li><li><p class=\"LegListTextStandard LegLevel3\">“” means a claim for damages in respect of personal injury which is made—\r</p><div><div class=\"LegAlphaList\"><div class=\"LegListItem\"><div class=\"LegLevel4No LegListItemNo\">(a)</div><p class=\"LegListTextStandard LegLevel4\">in connection with the same incident or series of incidents in connection with which the primary claim is made, and\r</p></div><div class=\"LegListItem\"><div class=\"LegLevel4No LegListItemNo\">(b)</div><p class=\"LegListTextStandard LegLevel4\">by a person other than the person who made the primary claim.\r</p></div></div></div></li></ul><p class=\"LegClearFix LegP2Container\"><span class=\"LegDS LegLHS LegP2No\" id=\"section-57-9\">(9)</span><span class=\"LegDS LegRHS LegP2Text\">This section does not apply to proceedings started by the issue of a claim form before the day on which this section comes into force.</span>\r</p><div class=\"LegAnnotations\"><p class=\"LegAnnotationsGroupHeading\">Commencement Information</p><div class=\"LegCommentaryItem\" id=\"commentary-key-b77a0eda0e8407357648cd484b49a95b\"><p class=\"LegCommentaryPara\"><span class=\"LegCommentaryType\">I1</span><span class=\"LegCommentaryText\"><a class=\"LegCitation\" href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/ukpga/2015/2/section/57\" title=\"Go to S. 57\">S. 57</a> in force at 13.4.2015 by <a class=\"LegCitation\" title=\"The Criminal Justice and Courts Act 2015 (Commencement No. 1, Saving and Transitional Provisions) Order 2015\" href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2015/778\">S.I. 2015/778</a>, <a class=\"LegCitation\" href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2015/778/article/3\" title=\"Go to The Criminal Justice and Courts Act 2015 (Commencement No. 1, Saving and Transitional Provisions) Order 2015 art. 3\">art. 3</a>, <a class=\"LegCitation\" href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/id/uksi/2015/778/schedule/1/paragraph/47\" title=\"Go to The Criminal Justice and Courts Act 2015 (Commencement No. 1, Saving and Transitional Provisions) Order 2015 Sch. 1 para. 47\"><strong>Sch. 1 para. 47</strong></a></span></p></div></div><span class=\"LegClearFix\"></span></div></div><p class=\"backToTop\"></p></div>",
 "markdown": null
}